## Before committing (agent)

1. **Inspect:** `git status`, `git diff`, `git log -5` — see [`$git-commit` procedures § Commit](../skills/git-commit/procedures.md#commit).
2. **Verify/format:** [`$agent-workflow`](../skills/agent-workflow/SKILL.md) step 4 + [`$monorepo-verify-gate` § Format gate](../skills/monorepo-verify-gate/SKILL.md#format-gate-mandatory--blocks-git-write) before git write. [Format fallback](../skills/monorepo-verify-gate/SKILL.md#format-fallback-step-5-only) only when git is requested without a prior step 4 pass.
3. Stage only task paths; exclude `.env`, credentials, accidental `dist/`; no `git add -A` unless the user wants everything; no `--no-verify` unless the user asks; no interactive git (`-i`).

Commit command (PowerShell):

```powershell
git commit -m "type(scope): short summary" -m "Optional body."
```

